                "text": "Today, I led a bipartisan letter with 17 colleagues urging CMS to modernize sleep apnea coverage. Outdated rules block timely diagnosis and care, especially for women and younger patients. \n\nFederal policy must reflect today\u2019s science.\nhttps://t.co/KYHxVtG7yH",
